name nwejm
category Package
revision 62129
shortdesc Support for the journal "North-Western European Journal of Mathematics"
longdesc The bundle includes LaTeX classes and BibLaTeX styles files
longdesc dedicated to the new journal "North-Western European Journal of
longdesc Mathematics": nwejm for the complete issues of the journal,
longdesc aimed at the NWEJM's team, nwejmart, intended for the authors
longdesc who wish to publish an article in the NWEJM. This class's goal
longdesc is to: faithfully reproduce the layout of the nwejm, thus
longdesc enabling the authors to be able to work their document in
longdesc actual conditions, provide a number of tools (commands and
longdesc environments) to facilitate the drafting of documents, in
longdesc particular those containing mathematical formulas.
